WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.582
(audience applauds)

00:00:01.582 --> 00:00:03.592
(tone beeps)
Name, please?

00:00:03.592 --> 00:00:05.692
(audience exclaims)
Thomas Middleditch.

00:00:07.597 --> 00:00:11.290
(tone beeps)
Listen, since I've met you,

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.680
I've nearly been incinerated,
drowned, shot at,

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:18.590
chopped into fish bait
or caught in the middle

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.240
of something sinister here.
(audience chuckles)

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:25.240
My guess is Dad found out
more than he was looking for.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:31.240
Until I'm sure, I'm going to
continue to do the things,

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.840
do things the way I think
they should be done.

00:00:36.462 --> 00:00:38.980
(audience laughs)

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.480
(whip thumps)

00:00:49.017 --> 00:00:50.126
Ow!
Sorry!

00:00:50.126 --> 00:00:51.020
(tone beeps)

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.853
Yep, I know; I know.

00:00:54.356 --> 00:00:56.227
(tone beeps)
Name, please?

00:00:56.227 --> 00:00:57.320
(audience cheers)
My name?

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.130
I'm Billy Eichner.

00:00:59.130 --> 00:00:59.963
(tone beeps)
What is this?

00:00:59.963 --> 00:01:01.760
Indiana, they're remaking Indiana Jones.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:02.593
Why?

00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:04.779
So what, he's gonna be bi now?

00:01:04.779 --> 00:01:06.553
(audience laughs)
Is it woke?

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:08.323
Leave me alone.

00:01:08.323 --> 00:01:10.103
I don't like fast women.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:13.092
I don't like women.
(audience laughs)

00:01:13.092 --> 00:01:15.760
(tone beeps)
Name, please?

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.100
Sam Richardson.
(tone beeps)

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.600
You know, one idea I had,
since this is an reimagining,

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.983
that maybe this time, he'd love snakes.

00:01:25.089 --> 00:01:27.590
Ohhh, I'm in heaven.
(audience laughs)

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:28.423
Oh, they like me.

00:01:28.423 --> 00:01:30.070
They may smell my snakes from home.

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:34.117
Do you have anybody to play the kid from

00:01:34.117 --> 00:01:35.880
"Temple Of Doom" short round?

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:38.000
You know, I can do a
pretty good Asian accent.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.510
Please don't.
It's pretty good.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:41.000
It's pretty funny, and time me.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.530
We're good, thanks though.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:44.783
It's -- I think I'll do it anyway.

00:01:44.783 --> 00:01:46.923
(tone beeps)
(audience laughs)

00:01:46.923 --> 00:01:49.013
(audience cheers)
Hi, my name's Adam Scott,

00:01:49.013 --> 00:01:52.036
and I'm auditioning for Indiana Jones.

00:01:52.036 --> 00:01:54.409
(tone beeps)

00:01:54.409 --> 00:01:57.540
(sand patters on floor)

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.069
Nah, that's too much, or I'll put some.

00:02:00.069 --> 00:02:00.902
(audience laughs)
No, let's go ahead

00:02:00.902 --> 00:02:03.100
and put some back in there.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.120
No, you know what?

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:06.260
I gotta take more out.
(sand patters on floor)

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.620
This is.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:08.453
This scene's -- you
don't have to be exact.

00:02:08.453 --> 00:02:09.286
No, it does need to be exact.

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.773
It's actually very precise.

00:02:13.773 --> 00:02:15.500
I mean, I don't know about you,

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.007
but I don't a boulder rolling
in here and killing all of us.

00:02:18.007 --> 00:02:20.850
(audience laughs)
So if you don't mind,

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.560
I'm gonna take a little
more time with this.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:23.953
Is that okay with you?

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.910
(audience exclaims and cheers)

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:32.743
See?

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:34.543
What did I tell you?

00:02:34.543 --> 00:02:35.500
You know what?

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.507
This is mine.

00:02:36.507 --> 00:02:38.479
(tone beeps)
(audience cheers)

00:02:38.479 --> 00:02:40.740
Hey.
Name, please?

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:41.995
Seth Green.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:44.192
(tone beeps)
Hey, how are you?

00:02:44.192 --> 00:02:46.410
I'm fine.
(audience laughs)

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.243
He's great.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.904
Seth is the only guy for the role.

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:52.926
(tone beeps)

00:02:52.926 --> 00:02:54.850
(audience cheers)
Name, please?

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.171
Tig Notaro.

00:02:56.171 --> 00:02:57.720
(tone beeps)

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.253
Oh no, a giant boulder.

00:03:01.713 --> 00:03:02.730
(audience laughs)

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:05.223
I always wondered why he didn't
just move out of the way.

00:03:05.223 --> 00:03:06.903
(tone beeps)
(audience cheers)

00:03:06.903 --> 00:03:09.123
Name, please?
Mr. Kevin Sedgwick,

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.553
six, four.

00:03:11.553 --> 00:03:12.800
(tone beeps)
So let's see.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.130
I was in "Animal House" with Karen Allen

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.184
who was in the "Raiders Of The Lost Ark."

00:03:18.184 --> 00:03:20.420
(audience laughs)
Sorry, what are you doing?

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.270
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:24.180
I was just seeing how many
degrees of separation I am

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:25.420
from Indiana Jones.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:26.640
It's two.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.470
I was in "Murder In The
First" with William H. Macy.

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:34.280
William H. Macy was in "Air
Force One" with Harrison Ford,

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:37.590
the Harrison Ford who is Indiana Jones.

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:38.680
So that's three.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.531
(chuckles) I could do
this all day, really.

00:03:40.531 --> 00:03:41.694
(audience laughs)

00:03:41.694 --> 00:03:42.580
(tone beeps)
But there's also

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.450
the option of, you know Seth,
they're doing sidekicks.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.490
Right?
Um-hmm.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.840
Yeah, I've been working on this character.

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.100
His name's Smitty.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.949
Say, man.
(audience laughs)

00:03:50.949 --> 00:03:52.383
What the heck?

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.730
And you know, it's
kinda at the end, right?

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.320
And you know, they're liftin' up the lead.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.970
And Indiana's like, "Don't look!"

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.467
And Smitty's kinda like, "Well yeah,

00:04:01.467 --> 00:04:02.647
it's the Ark of the Covenant."

00:04:02.647 --> 00:04:05.137
"Deal with it."
(audience laughs)

00:04:05.137 --> 00:04:06.970
Okay, thank you.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.542
Thank you, Thomas.
Oh, okay.

00:04:08.542 --> 00:04:10.455
(tone beeps)
(audience cheers)

00:04:10.455 --> 00:04:12.857
So name, please?
Dan Chadle.

00:04:12.857 --> 00:04:15.561
I thought it was Don Cheadle.

00:04:15.561 --> 00:04:17.090
Well, everybody thinks something,

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.170
