00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:19.910
Dan Chadle.
(audience chuckles)

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:23.780
Does he have lasers that
shoot out of his chest?

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.460
Not traditionally.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.310
You know, let's add that.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.143
Throw that in.

00:04:28.143 --> 00:04:30.655
I'll pay for it.
(audience chuckles)

00:04:30.655 --> 00:04:31.650
Zheeeoo!
(audience laughs)

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:34.500
Zhoo, zhoo, zhoo, the sound
effect, you just put those in.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.235
Oh, this is for free.

00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:38.442
Zhoo, zhoo.
What are you doing?

00:04:38.442 --> 00:04:39.873
Yeah, attitude,

00:04:39.873 --> 00:04:44.873
zhoo, pew, pew.
(audience laughs)

00:04:45.703 --> 00:04:48.620
So what are you doing?
What?

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:49.870
Did you see the movie?

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:50.933
Yes.
Okay.

00:04:52.202 --> 00:04:53.280
(audience laughs)
Can you just--

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:55.353
